+
+## In-app AI verification — 2026-10-21
+
+36 automated tests pass, including in-page submit → generation → private reply save, save-error retry without regenerating, download/generation cancellation, cross-user denial, idempotent save, and deleted-prompt denial. Actual model inference was also run independently using the pinned Qwen3-1.7B weights on CPU and Qwen3-0.6B using the WebAssembly execution provider. Japanese text was generated; the outputs show that factual and conversational quality are limited. These checks do not constitute physical phone, WebGPU or browser UI QA. The standard browser path uses q4f16 WebGPU; native CPU verification used q8. The light WASM path uses the tested q8 weights.
+
+No new secret, paid model API, account, hosting plan or payment contract was created. No model weights or real user history are committed. The vendor JavaScript bundle is version-pinned with an SHA-256 in web/vendor/SOURCES.txt. ChatGPT MCP remains optional and is not used by the on-device UI.
